==German==
===Etymology===
Old High German {{term|zelt|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*teldą}}. Compare Danish {{term|telt|lang=da}} (whence English {{term|tilt|lang=en}}), Dutch [[telt]], Old Norse {{term|tjald||tent|lang=non}} (whence Norwegian Bokmål {{term|tjeld}}).

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|De-Zelt.ogg|audio}}
